  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Tofu Stir Fry.png|200px|left|Tofu stir fry]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 89\n |price = 1 to 306\n |time = 1 h 15 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|wokk|bigger|link=Wok Kitchen}}\n |xp = 37\n |base = 85\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 1 h 3 min\n}}\n'''Tofu stir fry''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 89. It is not used to make any other product.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making tofu stir fry'''===\n[[File:Wok Kitchen.png|150px|left|Wok Kitchen]]\nTofu Stir Fry is made in the [[Wok Kitchen]].\n\nTo make the stir fry, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Soybean.png|75px|Soybeans|link=Soybean]]\n|[[File:Onion.png|75px|Onions|link=Onion]]\n|[[File:Broccoli.png|75px|Broccoli|link=Broccoli]]\n|[[File:Sesame.png|75px|Sesame|link=Sesame]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 15 minutes to make one bowl, and 1 hours and 3 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] mitchen. Each tofu stir fry gives players 37 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling tofu stir fry'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Tofu stir fry can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3060 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bowls.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a tofu stir fry costs 264 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 tofu stir fry per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Gebratener Tofu\n|es = Salteado de tofu\n|fr = Tofu Sauté\n|it = Tofu in padella\n|nl = Tofuroerbak\n|no = Wokrett med tofu\n}}\n[[pt-br:Refogado de tofu]]\n\n[[Category:Wok Kitchen Products]]\n[[Category:Soybean Products]]\n[[Category:Sesame Products]]\n[[Category:Onion Products]]\n[[Category:Broccoli Products]]",
